'''''Somatolophia''''' is a genus of [[moth]]s in the family [[Geometridae]] described by [[George Duryea Hulst]] in 1896.<ref>{{LepIndex |id=246050 |access-date=April 8, 2019}}</ref>

==Selected species==
*''[[Somatolophia haydenata]]'' <small>(Packard, 1876)</small>
*''[[Somatolophia ectrapelaria]]'' <small>(Grossbeck, 1908)</small>
*''[[Somatolophia pallescens]]'' <small>McDunnough, 1940</small>

